@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# OLED faces C3 example
+
+ESP32-C3, 4 MB flash, no PSRAM; SSD1306 128×64 at I²C address 0x3c.
+Specific wiring: SDA20, SCL10, I²S BCLK2/WS1/speaker DIN3/microphone SD8;
+GPIO9 BOOT/action. Shared-clock 24 kHz upstream NoAudioCodecDuplex.
+Compile tested only in this extracted integration. See the faces repository docs.
+No custom microphone processing, Wi-Fi tuning, queue changes or private diagnostics.
+This board has its own OTA identity; it does not change another board's pins.
